# MITRE ATT&CK Mapping

## T1046 — Network Service Discovery

DET-001 maps to **MITRE ATT&CK T1046 — Network Service Discovery** within the **Discovery** tactic.

Network Service Discovery describes activity used to identify services running on remote systems or network infrastructure. Port scanning is one method an adversary may use to identify available services and potential opportunities for further access.

### ATT&CK Mapping

| Field | Value |
|---|---|
| Tactic | Discovery |
| Technique | Network Service Discovery |
| Technique ID | T1046 |
| Detection | DET-001 — Network Port Scan Detection |
| Data Source | pfSense `filterlog` |
| SIEM | Splunk Enterprise |
| Detection Type | Behavioral / Threshold-Based |
| Severity | Medium |
| Status | Validated |

