## Detection Logic

DET-001 uses pfSense firewall telemetry to identify a high number of unique TCP destination ports associated with the controlled ATTACK_NET source.

```spl
index=network process=filterlog "10.10.20.10" "10.10.10.1" "tcp"
| rex "10\.10\.20\.10,10\.10\.10\.1,\d+,(?<dest_port>\d+)"
| stats dc(dest_port) as unique_ports count as attempts
| where unique_ports>=20
```

### Detection Threshold

```text
Unique Destination Ports: >=20
Detection Window:          5 minutes
Protocol:                  TCP
```

The threshold was selected for the controlled lab environment and should not be interpreted as a universal production threshold.

A production implementation would require baselining and tuning according to normal network behavior, authorized scanners, asset roles, and expected administrative activity.

